---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Playground"
  description="Small SEO games by Robert Lora: crawl a site as Googlebot, guess the daily SEO word, play snake, and test your search volume and Google update instincts."
  currentSlug="play"
>
  <p class="echo" aria-hidden="true"><span class="cwd">~/play</span><span class="chev"></span><span class="cmd">ls</span></p>
  <h1 class="page-title">playground</h1>
  <p class="lede">games and toys I built for fun. most of them are about search.</p>
  <ul class="runs">
    <li><a href="/play/crawl/"><span class="run-cmd">./crawl</span><span class="run-title">crawl</span><span class="run-desc">you're googlebot on a crawl budget. index the good pages, rescue the orphans, dodge redirect loops and noindex traps.</span><span class="run-keys"><kbd>arrows</kbd>, <kbd>WASD</kbd> or <kbd>hjkl</kbd>, tap on phone</span><span class="run-go" aria-hidden="true">run</span></a></li>
    <li><a href="/play/serpdle/"><span class="run-cmd">./serpdle</span><span class="run-title">serpdle</span><span class="run-desc">one five-letter SEO word a day, six guesses. same word for everyone.</span><span class="run-keys">type, <kbd>enter</kbd> to guess</span><span class="run-go" aria-hidden="true">run</span></a></li>
    <li><a href="/play/serpent/"><span class="run-cmd">./serpent</span><span class="run-title">serpent</span><span class="run-desc">snake, but you're climbing the SERP. unlockable colors and achievements.</span><span class="run-keys"><kbd>arrows</kbd> or <kbd>WASD</kbd>, swipe on phone</span><span class="run-go" aria-hidden="true">run</span></a></li>
    <li><a href="/play/updates/"><span class="run-cmd">./updates</span><span class="run-title">name that google update</span><span class="run-desc">panda to the latest core update. guess it from the description, or put them in order.</span><span class="run-go" aria-hidden="true">run</span></a></li>
    <li><a href="/play/keywords/"><span class="run-cmd">./keywords</span><span class="run-title">seo intuition test</span><span class="run-desc">which keyword gets searched more? real US volumes from ahrefs, pulled october 2026.</span><span class="run-keys"><kbd>←</kbd> <kbd>→</kbd> to pick</span><span class="run-go" aria-hidden="true">run</span></a></li>
  </ul>
</Layout>
